<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Citrix raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Citrix raised.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Company analyst John Powers raised the rating on Citrix Systems Inc from long-term attractive to buy.</p>
<p>-- Powers said a licensing deal with Microsoft payment revenues, with recognition over time of a one time $75 million lump-sum payment, should not be capitalized, in his view.</p>
<p>-- Without the EPS of $0.32 that represents, his next year's estimate is $1.27. Cash on the balance sheet of $8 per share is a significant factor.</p>
<p>-- Powers sees substantial upside to his published $1.59 for next year but, with a ramp that is still hard to predict, he is not willing to post higher numbers yet.</p>
</text>
